From c2c2fe1c80cd9e3b3abc517bf8a4873c94aa3523 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tablet-image <tablet-image@localhost>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:12:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] media: atomisp: make both Lenovo Miix 2 8 cameras usable

- ov2722: report SBGGR10 from set_fmt as get_fmt does, so links validate
- try_fmt/enum_framesizes: let the ISP crop sensors without crop support to
  a width whose lines need no padding, which PipeWire clients require
- gmin: leave the Bay Trail Crystal Cove V18X/X285 rails on; they also
  supply the touchscreen
- ov2722: flip the upside-down module, run the sensor's own AEC/AGC
- default white balance for the two modules
---
